"Construções que só existem em português"

;"subir e descer: suba na árvore, desça da árvore. Sozinhos, viram as
  direções cima e baixo (ver AJUSTA-LEXV)."
<SYNTAX SUBIR OBJECT (FIND CLIMBBIT) (ON-GROUND IN-ROOM) = V-CLIMB-UP>
<SYNTAX SUBIR IN OBJECT (FIND CLIMBBIT) (ON-GROUND IN-ROOM) = V-CLIMB-UP>
<SYNTAX SUBIR ON OBJECT (FIND CLIMBBIT) (ON-GROUND IN-ROOM) = V-CLIMB-UP>
<SYNTAX SUBIR TO OBJECT (FIND CLIMBBIT) (ON-GROUND IN-ROOM) = V-CLIMB-UP>
<SYNTAX SUBIR WITH OBJECT (FIND CLIMBBIT) (ON-GROUND IN-ROOM) = V-CLIMB-UP>
<SYNONYM SUBIR SUBA SOBE>
<SYNTAX DESCER OBJECT (FIND CLIMBBIT) (ON-GROUND IN-ROOM) = V-CLIMB-DOWN>
<SYNTAX DESCER FROM OBJECT (FIND CLIMBBIT) (ON-GROUND IN-ROOM) = V-CLIMB-DOWN>
<SYNTAX DESCER WITH OBJECT (FIND CLIMBBIT) (ON-GROUND IN-ROOM) = V-CLIMB-DOWN>
<SYNONYM DESCER DESCA DESCE>

<SYNTAX LOOK OBJECT (HELD CARRIED ON-GROUND IN-ROOM MANY) = V-EXAMINE>
<SYNTAX LOOK TO OBJECT (HELD CARRIED ON-GROUND IN-ROOM MANY) = V-EXAMINE>
<SYNTAX ENTER IN OBJECT = V-THROUGH>
<SYNTAX EXIT FROM OBJECT = V-EXIT>
;"pela = por (WITH): entre pela janela, saia pela janela, olhe pela janela,
  suba pela chaminé"
<SYNTAX ENTER WITH OBJECT = V-THROUGH>
<SYNTAX EXIT WITH OBJECT = V-THROUGH>
<SYNTAX LOOK WITH OBJECT = V-LOOK-INSIDE>
<SYNTAX TALK WITH OBJECT (FIND ACTORBIT) (IN-ROOM) = V-TELL>
<SYNTAX KNOCK IN OBJECT = V-KNOCK>
<SYNTAX LISTEN OBJECT = V-LISTEN>
<SYNTAX TIE OBJECT IN OBJECT = V-TIE>
<SYNTAX TIE OBJECT ON OBJECT = V-TIE>
<SYNTAX BLOW OBJECT = V-LAMP-OFF>
;"dê corda no canário (AJUSTA-LEXV troca dê corda por wind)"
<SYNTAX WIND IN OBJECT = V-WIND>
<SYNTAX WIND TO OBJECT = V-WIND>

;"Região 3: barragem e rio.
  encha a garrafa de água (o de antes de água é a preposição FROM);
  atraque = land (direção, como no rótulo do barco); zarpe = lance;
  bombeie o barco (o original só tem pump up);
  embarque no barco, desembarque do barco."
<SYNTAX FILL OBJECT (FIND CONTBIT) (HELD CARRIED ON-GROUND IN-ROOM)
	FROM OBJECT = V-FILL PRE-FILL>
<SYNONYM LAND ATRAQUE ATRACAR ATRACA APORTE APORTAR>
<SYNONYM LAUNCH ZARPE ZARPAR ZARPA>
<SYNTAX PUMP OBJECT = V-PUMP>
<SYNTAX PUMP OBJECT WITH OBJECT = V-PUMP>
<SYNTAX BOARD IN OBJECT (FIND VEHBIT) (ON-GROUND IN-ROOM) = V-BOARD PRE-BOARD>
<SYNTAX DISEMBARK FROM OBJECT (FIND VEHBIT) (ON-GROUND IN-ROOM)
	= V-DISEMBARK>

;"Região 4: labirinto e ladrão. fure o olho do ciclope com a espada (poke),
  esfaqueie o ladrão com a faca (stab)."
<SYNONYM POKE FURE FURAR FURA CUTUQUE CUTUCAR CUTUCA ESPETE ESPETAR ESPETA>
<SYNONYM STAB ESFAQUEIE ESFAQUEAR ESFAQUEIA APUNHALE APUNHALAR APUNHALA>

;"Região 5: Templo, Hades e espíritos. templo, como tesouro (acima), é a
  palavra mágica que leva do Templo à Sala do Tesouro e de volta."
<SYNONYM TREASURE TEMPLO>
;"amarre o troll com a corda = tie up troll with rope"
<SYNTAX TIE OBJECT (FIND ACTORBIT) (ON-GROUND IN-ROOM) WITH OBJECT
	(FIND TOOLBIT) (ON-GROUND IN-ROOM HELD CARRIED HAVE) = V-TIE-UP>
